margarita-brozovic|marriage|1800|notes/selce-marriage-1800-jellicic-drozovic.md|the bride of the same entry, «Margarita filia Joannis et Catharinae Drozovich» - the surname reads DROZOVICH, not Brozović
mathia-jellicic|marriage-of-child|1800|notes/selce-marriage-1800-jellicic-drozovic.md|named as the groom's father, «Mathiae … Jellichich»
margarita|marriage-of-child|1800|notes/selce-marriage-1800-jellicic-drozovic.md|named as the groom's mother, «Margaritae Jellichich»
joanni-brozovic|marriage-of-child|1800|notes/selce-marriage-1800-jellicic-drozovic.md|named as the bride's father, «Joannis … Drozovich»
catharina-2|marriage-of-child|1800|notes/selce-marriage-1800-jellicic-drozovic.md|named as the bride's mother, «Catharinae Drozovich»
jacob-pilipic|marriage|1747|notes/karlobag-marriage-1747-pilepich-luckinic.md|Karlobag marriages 1736-1804 image 283 right (DGS 5481649), «Dan 22. Novembra … sakupih u S. Matrimonij Jakova Pillepicha ij Kattu heer pokoin[og] Vicha Luckinicha», witnesses Pop Nikula Jurich and Sig. Mattio Borri
catherina-catta-luckinic|marriage|1747|notes/karlobag-marriage-1747-pilepich-luckinic.md|the bride of the same entry, «Katta, heer pokoin[og] Vicha Luckinicha» - daughter of the late Vicko Luckinich
vicentius-vicko-luckinic|marriage-of-child|1747|notes/karlobag-marriage-1747-pilepich-luckinic.md|named as the bride's late father («pokojnog Vicha Luckinicha»): dead by 22 November 1747
josephus-josip-pilipic|marriage|1798|notes/karlobag-marriage-1798-pilepich-smojver.md|Karlobag marriages 1736-1804 image 343 right (DGS 5481649), 14 Feb 1798: «consensu Josephi viduei [Pilepich?] et Mariae filiae Vincenti [Smojver?]» - PROBABLE: surnames faint, date, first names and the father's given name fit; he is written as a widower
