pauli-tomljanovic|marriage-of-child|1785|notes/karlobag-marriage-1785-gerkacs-tomljanovic.md|named as the bride's father, «Pauli Tomljenovich», with the place «Montani Stanize»
vicentius-fabiano-smojver-vukic|marriage|1774|notes/karlobag-marriage-1774-smojver-bacchi.md|Karlobag marriages 1736-1804 image 306 right (DGS 5481649), 2 May 1774: «consensu Vincentii filii Josephi Smojver, vulgo nuncupati Vukich, ac Olivae filiae defuncti Caetani Bacchi», witnesses Dno Nicolao Jurich and Francisco [Lukulich?]
