caetano-bacchi|baptism-of-child|1754|notes/karlobag-marriage-1774-smojver-bacchi.md|Karlobag baptisms page 215, early Jan 1754: «sina Gajetana y Anne Bachi» - a son Silvester of a Caetanus Bacchi and Anne (probably 214; not proved)
